cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data lake it builds, please cite both the pipeline and the UniProt Consortium's current paper (preferred-citation)."
type: software
title: uniprot-parquet
abstract: "Pipeline that converts the UniProtKB JSON release into a sorted, validated Parquet data lake with a lossless nested layer and a Python client."
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ebi-uniprot/uniprot-parquet"
authors:
